    "ssky_faqs_zNdeMD": {
      "type": "ssky-faqs",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_3Hqec7": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<p>Frequently Asked Questions About <br/>Free Market Rules Curriculum</p>",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "heading_weight": "bold"
          }
        },
        "faq_h3bFhB": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Can I Use These Books for Homeschooling?</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "bold",
            "answer": "<p>Absolutely! Our economics books are a great resource for homeschooling families. With clear, easy-to-follow chapters, engaging activities, and companion guides, they provide a solid foundation in economics and help kids think critically about real-world issues.</p>",
            "text_size_b": "medium",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        },
        "faq_qCbA6Q": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Are the Economics Books Aligned With School Curricula?</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "bold",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, these economics books are designed to complement most standard school curricula. They introduce important economic concepts that align with educational standards, making them a great addition to classroom learning.</p>",
            "text_size_b": "medium",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        },
        "faq_i8gDDc": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>What Age Group Are These Economics Books Suitable For?</strong></p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "regular",
            "answer": "<p>Our economics books are perfect for children aged 8-12. The content is written in a way that’s accessible and fun for younger readers while still providing valuable information about economics and personal finance.</p>",
            "text_size_b": "regular",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        },
        "faq_zdfAF6": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>I don't understand economics very well. Does it matter?</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "bold",
            "answer": "<p>The Tuttle Twins Free Market Rules curriculum is a gold mine of information and will educate you on any gaps in your education at the same time you are reading with your kids. No need to understand anything, just your interest and curiosity to learn as a family will set you up for success.</p>",
            "text_size_b": "medium",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        },
        "faq_DQxrJd": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>How much time will it take to teach my kids these ideas?</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "bold",
            "answer": "<p>Without this curriculum, teaching your kids economics could take many years if you are lucky enough to have the right conversations at the right times and then even know what to share. With the Tuttle Twins Free Market Rules you can set up a study program that suits your family and study patterns. You’re free to move through all 30 units at whatever pace best suits your family.</p>",
            "text_size_b": "medium",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        },
        "faq_FrgYqH": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>What are the Parent Guides?</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "bold",
            "answer": "<p>The Parent Guides are optional digital PDF files that you will be able to download after purchasing. A link will be provided on the “Thank You” page after ordering, as well as in your confirmation email you receive. While not necessary, many parents find that they are super helpful supplements so they can be better prepared to answer questions.</p>",
            "text_size_b": "medium",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        },
        "faq_HzMHTP": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>What is the age range?</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "bold",
            "answer": "<p>Our curriculum is written for the entire family. Each lesson has two activities, one for younger children and one for older children. There’s information for parents, too, and discussion questions for the whole family. No matter the age of your child, there will be content for them.</p>",
            "text_size_b": "medium",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        },
