            "alignment": "left",
            "text": "<p>If you’re interested in teaching your child about personal responsibility, consider our colorful <a href=\"https://tuttletwins.com/collections/toddler-books\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">toddler books</span></a>, exciting <a href=\"https://tuttletwins.com/collections/books-for-teens\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">books for teens</span></a>, or our engaging <a href=\"https://tuttletwins.com/collections/bundles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">book bundles</span></a>. You can also explore our <a href=\"https://www.tuttletwins.com/pages/history\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">history books</span></a> for an enriching educational experience that connects the past with present-day concepts.</p>",
